d676fd0f-bde0-4c55-b34c-c76a8457dca0	Lotka's Law and Computer Science Literature	An experiment to verify the satisfaction of Lotka's law, with the papers published in the area of computer science, is reported. It is seen that the estimates of this law deviate considerably from the observations. Need for further experiments to verify Lotka's law in the area of applied sciences and engineering is emphasized.	{"Lotka's law","computer science literature","publication frequency","citation statistics"}	https://doi.org/10.1002/asi.4630300109	\N	https://doi.org/10.1002/asi.4630300109	1979	1979-01-01	Journal of the American Society for Information Science	Wiley	OpenAlex	https://openalex.org/W2108953344	2026-11-20 20:04:07.893131+00	2026-11-20 20:04:07.893131+00
